There were four comic-sized reprint books that collected various one shots and stories including Civil War: 
- Civil War: Casualties of War (Marvel, 2007 series) #[nn];
- Civil War: Amazing Spider-Man (Marvel, 2007 series) #[nn];
- Civil War: Black Panther War Crimes (Marvel, 2007 series)#[nn];
- Civil War: Thunderbolts Swimming With Sharks (Marvel, 2006 series) #[nn]

There was also Civil War Chronicles (Marvel, 2007 series) #1-12 which reprinted the entire limited series with various crossovers.

There was a parody one-shot entitled Ultimate Civil War: Spider-Ham (Marvel, 2007 series) #1 which came out during the run of the limited series as well as a What If? Civil War (Marvel, 2008 series) #1 one-shot and a Civil War: House of M (Marvel, 2008 series) #1-5 limited series that were published after the series concluded.

Civil War was followed-up by a short crossover event entitled "Casualties of War" which ran through:
- Blade (Marvel, 2006 series) #5;
- Ghost Rider (Marvel, 2006 series) #8-11;
- Moon Knight (Marvel, 2006 series) #7-9;
- Winter Soldier: Winter Kills (Marvel, 2007 series) #1;
- Wolverine (Marvel, 2003 series) #48.

"Casualties of War" was immediately followed by "The Initiative" crossover which ran through a number of comics as well as launched a few new series and limited series.

